    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful temple is attacked by security forces. A military laboratory is invaded by terrorists. Everyone is looking for Hieman, a man with a mysterious illness and dangerous connections. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore multiple locations, gathering information, fighting enemies and solve simple puzzles. Be sure to level up and check every loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some locations change the character in your control, see their side of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
